    "3. Turn on “Enable Telegram bot”, then message your bot once to lock it to your chat.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 打开“启用 Telegram 机器人”，然后给你的机器人发一条消息，把它锁定到你的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "384 (fine)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "384（精细）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A goal the agent runs on its own, on a schedule.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个由智能体按计划自行执行的目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single, well-lit photo of one object works best. The subject is auto-cut from its background.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单个物体、光线充足的照片效果最好。主体会自动从背景中抠出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ACE-Step 1.5 has no download yet — convert the weights on-device with tests/convert_acestep_weights.py (see the repo README). They install to ~/.mlx-serve/models/local/.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ACE-Step 1.5 暂无下载 —— 请用 tests/convert_acestep_weights.py 在本机转换权重（见仓库 README）。转换结果会安装到 ~/.mlx-serve/models/local/。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Voice…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加声音…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a recording of a voice to clone. It's normalized and kept in ~/.mlx-serve/voice-clips so any agent can use it later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一段用于克隆的录音。它会被标准化并保存在 ~/.mlx-serve/voice-clips，之后任何智能体都能使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add reference image…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加参考图…"
