    "Hands-free voice assistant — talk to the model with no chat window required. Speech-to-text and text-to-speech run locally on your Mac. When this popover is closed, feedback is audio-only; reopen it for status and controls.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免动手语音助手 —— 无需对话窗口即可与模型交谈。语音识别与语音合成都在你的 Mac 本地运行。此弹窗关闭时只有语音反馈；重新打开可查看状态和控制项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
