    "Spotlight-style prompt panel on %@: summon it from any app, ask the local model, and press ⌘↩ to continue in the chat window. If nothing happens on %@, macOS may be using it for input-source switching (System Settings → Keyboard → Keyboard Shortcuts → Input Sources).": {
