    "Voice mode (%@) — talk to the model hands-free. Speech-to-text and text-to-speech run locally on your Mac; the model only handles text (and tools/thinking if enabled).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音模式（%1$@）—— 免动手与模型交谈。语音识别与语音合成都在你的 Mac 本地运行；模型只处理文本（以及已启用的工具／思考）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voices blend: type several separated by commas (af_bella,af_sky) to make a new one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "声音混合：用逗号分隔输入多个（af_bella,af_sky）即可合成新声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voices, lip sync and timing follow this clip — it becomes the video's soundtrack. Runs on the 2-stage pipeline.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人声、口型和时间轴都跟随这段片段 —— 它会成为视频的配乐。使用两阶段流程运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WAV, MP3, M4A or AAC. The clip drives the performance and becomes the video's soundtrack.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
